>Can anyone tell where I can get hold of PC NEThack?
>
Assuming you are on the UNIX system, ftp'ing as follows:

ftp -i linc.cis.upenn.edu

should get you to the site.

Then you must change the directory to:

pub/NH3.0/PC

There you will find the required nethack sources, beware the total
kilobytes required is approx. 600k, so you better have that space
available. btw. that is in compressed form, wait till you blow it up!

